"pull":true}},"body":"### Steps to reproduce the behavior\r\n1) Create `usePiniaStore.ts`,\r\n  ```\r\n  export const usePiniaStore = defineStore(\"piniaStore\", () => {\r\n    const error = ref<any>(null)\r\n\r\n    return {\r\n      error,\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n  ```\r\n\r\n2) Finally use `storeToRefs`,\r\n  ```\r\n  const { error } = storeToRefs(usePiniaStore())\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nYou will see error has an `any` type instead of `Ref<any>`.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"622\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-12-30 at 6 27 04 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31353695/147752913-252cf272-36b6-495f-8c4e-a2ca3e58e0ec.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nI expect error to be `Ref<any>` instead of just `any`.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nReturns `any` instead of `Ref<any>`.\r\n\r\n### Additional information\r\n\r\nHere is my `package.json`,\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"vue-3\",\r\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\r\n    \"build\": \"vue-tsc --noEmit && vite build\",\r\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"dependencies\": {\r\n    \"pinia\": \"^2.0.9\",\r\n    \"vue\": \"^3.2.25\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"devDependencies\": {\r\n    \"@types/node\": \"^17.0.5\",\r\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^2.0.0\",\r\n    \"typescript\": \"^4.4.4\",\r\n    \"vite\": \"^2.7.2\",\r\n    \"vue-tsc\": \"^0.29.8\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/pinia/issues/933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/pinia/issues/933/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5829973957,"node_id":"RTE_lADOCCum185BCKqSzwAAAAFbflfF","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/5829973957","actor":{"login":"posva","id":664177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu